    "content": "D. \\(2\\sqrt{5}\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.097,
      0.103,
      0.175,
      0.119
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "【答案】C",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.097,
      0.131,
      0.152,
      0.147
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "【解析】",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.095,
      0.158,
      0.764,
      0.175
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "【分析】结合等差数列性质将 \\(C\\) 代换，求出直线恒过的定点，采用数形结合法即可求解.",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.094,
      0.185,
      0.834,
      0.213
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "【详解】因为 \\(a, b, c\\) 成等差数列，所以 \\(2b = a + c\\)，\\(c = 2b - a\\)，代入直线方程 \\(ax + by + c = 0\\) 得",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.088,
      0.23,
      0.688,
      0.273
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\(ax + by + 2b - a = 0\\) ，即 \\(a(x - 1) + b(y + 2) = 0\\) ，令 \\(\\begin{cases} x - 1 = 0 \\\\ y + 2 = 0 \\end{cases}\\) 得 \\(\\begin{cases} x = 1 \\\\ y = -2, \\end{cases}\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.086,
      0.296,
      0.687,
      0.323
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "故直线恒过 \\((1, -2)\\)，设 \\(P(1, -2)\\)，圆化为标准方程得：\\(C: x^2 + (y + 2)^2 = 5\\)，",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.086,
      0.343,
      0.682,
      0.369
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "设圆心为 \\(C\\) ，画出直线与圆的图形，由图可知，当 \\(PC \\perp AB\\) 时，\\(\\left|AB\\right|\\) 最小，",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.088,
      0.388,
      0.691,
      0.415
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\n\\left| P C \\right| = 1, \\left| A C \\right| = \\left| r \\right| = \\sqrt {5}    ,    \\text {此时} \\left| A B \\right| = 2 \\left| A P \\right| = 2 \\sqrt {A C ^ {2} - P C ^ {2}} = 2 \\sqrt {5 - 1} = 4.\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "bbox": [
      0.088,
