    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "13. \\( \\left(\\frac{1}{3}+x\\right)^{10} \\) 的展开式中，各项系数的最大值是____.",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.097,
      0.73,
      0.172,
      0.746
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "【答案】5",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.097,
      0.758,
      0.152,
      0.774
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "【解析】",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.095,
      0.792,
      0.911,
      0.884
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "【分析】先设展开式中第 项系数最大，则根据通项公式有 \\(\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} C_{10}^{r} \\left( \\frac{1}{3} \\right)^{10 - r} \\geq C_{10}^{r + 1} \\left( \\frac{1}{3} \\right)^{9 - r} \\\\ C_{10}^{r} \\left( \\frac{1}{3} \\right)^{10 - r} \\geq C_{10}^{r - 1} \\left( \\frac{1}{3} \\right)^{11 - r} \\end{array} \\right.\\)，进而求出即 \\(r + 1\\)",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
